WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.860
Here's the easiest upgrade for your videos and it costs nothing.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.100
Face a window.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.300
Don't put the window behind you because that turns you into a shadow.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.260
Turn around so the daylight lands on your face.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.420
Then take one step back so it's nice and soft.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.360
Morning or late afternoon light works best.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.190
Try it on your next video and you'll see the difference straight away.
